<Component>
  <Description>
  	Operation Amplifier (OpAmp) Model LM324 with 5 standard-pins.
	Spice and qucs_symbol sections copied and modified from open source library of qucs version 0.0.14:
	Original Authors of these sections: Vadim Kuznetsov <ra3xdh@gmail.com> and Timofey Moiseev <voig1396@gmail.com>
	Licensed under same GPL versions as these sections.
	Modifications to AMizer: Benedikt Sessler, see AMizer Homepage
  </Description>
